STARTFONT 2.1
COMMENT Times Italic 22px strike for CrossPoint Reader, filling the gap between
COMMENT the X.org Adobe 100dpi 14pt (20px) and 18pt (25px) strikes.
COMMENT Grid-fitted from URW Nimbus outlines, then hand-tuned pixel by pixel to
COMMENT the conventions of the Adobe strikes; accents composed from tuned parts.
FONT -CrossPoint-Times-Medium-I-Normal--22-160-100-100-P-108-ISO10646-1
SIZE 16 100 100
FONTBOUNDINGBOX 26 32 -3 -8
STARTPROPERTIES 21
FOUNDRY "CrossPoint"
FAMILY_NAME "Times"
WEIGHT_NAME "Medium"
SLANT "I"
SETWIDTH_NAME "Normal"
ADD_STYLE_NAME ""
PIXEL_SIZE 22
POINT_SIZE 160
RESOLUTION_X 100
RESOLUTION_Y 100
SPACING "P"
AVERAGE_WIDTH 108
CHARSET_REGISTRY "ISO10646"
CHARSET_ENCODING "1"
CAP_HEIGHT 15
X_HEIGHT 10
FONT_ASCENT 18
FONT_DESCENT 5
FACE_NAME "Times Italic"
DEFAULT_CHAR 0
FULL_NAME "Times Italic"
ENDPROPERTIES
